From f4f0d974a616b4f5c9902713a4ab4f36a6abd8a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:50:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add MiniCPM-V-4.5 adapter (minicpmv model family)

New models/minicpmv.py plugs into the existing generate_one interface (greedy,
max_new_tokens 2, first-token A-D label scoring). run_cross_locale._build_model_adapter
and run_rel_followup's family check accept model_family minicpmv; code_identity and the
cross-locale contract also hash minicpmv.py. Config: minicpm_v4_5_8b_4090.yaml
(pinned revision, max_slice_nums 9).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
